%H A142974 <a href="/index/Rec#order_04">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (5,-9,7,-2).
%F A142974 Binomial transform of [1, 1, -1, 1, 1, 1, ...].
%F A142974 From _R. J. Mathar_, Jul 31 2008: (Start)
%F A142974 O.g.f.: (1-3*x+x^2+3*x^3)/((1-x)^3*(1-2*x)).
%F A142974 a(n) = 4*n + 2 - 2*A000217(n+1) + 2^n. (End)
%F A142974 a(n) = 2^n - n*(n-1). - _Emeric Deutsch_, Aug 09 2008
%F A142974 E.g.f.: exp(x)*(exp(x) - x^2). - _Andrew Howroyd_, Nov 14 2026
%e A142974 a(5) = 12 = (1, 5, 10, 10, 5, 1) dot (1, 1, -1, 1, 1, 1) = (1 + 5 - 10 + 10, + 5, + 1).
%p A142974 a:=proc(n) options operator, arrow: 2^n-n*(n-1) end proc: seq(a(n),n=0..32); # _Emeric Deutsch_, Aug 09 2008
